# React / Next.js

## Before editing
- Read the page/component + its direct hook/util imports only.
- App Router: `app/` layout → page → colocated components.
- Pages Router: `pages/` → `_app` → shared `components/`.

## Patterns
- Functional components; extract hooks for reusable logic.
- Server Components by default (App Router); `'use client'` only when needed.

## Scope
- Never read `node_modules/`, `.next/`, `dist/`, or `coverage/`.
- For API calls, read the matching backend route — do not scan all endpoints.
